## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design multi-tenant resource control with dynamic priorities using CKNE.

## Key Concepts
- CKNE-based quota shaping
- Cache eviction policy with cross-tenant fairness
- Minute-by-minute degradation loop and SLA preservation
- Telemetry for per-tenant fairness and SLA validation

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo quota function
function quotaForCKNE(ckne, total) {
  const minQuota = 128;
  const base = total * 0.25;
  return Math.max(minQuota, base * (1 + ckne * 3));
}
```

